{"id":"f16a9e18c4d68568","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-measure4-tight-measure-family.md","title":"ZFC Measure4 Tight Measure Family","display":"df-zfc-measure4-tight-measure-family — ZFC Measure4 Tight Measure Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure4-tight-measure-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure4-tight-measure-family","58-df-zfc-measure11-tight-measure-family"],"display":"df-zfc-measure4-tight-measure-family — ZFC Measure4 Tight Measure Family","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-compact]]","[[58-df-topological-space]]","[[58-df-probability]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure4-tight-measure-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure4-tight-measure-family</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure11-tight-measure-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure4-tight-measure-family — ZFC Measure4 Tight Measure Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"58-df-compact\">58-df-compact</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5e0db065132180df\" href=\"?note=5e0db065132180df\" title=\"58-df-probability\">58-df-probability</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (underlying space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> (topology)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> (measure family)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\)</span> (compactness predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"58-df-compact\">58-df-compact</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}\\)</span> (probability-measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5e0db065132180df\" href=\"?note=5e0db065132180df\" title=\"58-df-probability\">58-df-probability</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4TightMeasureFamily}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4TightMeasureFamily}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}tight\\text{-}measure\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4TightMeasureFamily}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall\\mu\\in\\mathcal M\\;\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mu,X,\\mathcal B(X,\\tau))\\land\\forall\\varepsilon&gt;0\\;\\exists K\\subseteq X\\;(\\mathrm{Compact}_S(K,\\{U\\cap K:U\\in\\tau\\})\\land\\forall\\mu\\in\\mathcal M\\;(\\mu(X\\setminus K)&lt;\\varepsilon))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}tight\\text{-}measure\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4TightMeasureFamily}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall\\mu\\in\\mathcal M\\;\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mu,X,\\mathcal B(X,\\tau))\\land\\forall\\varepsilon&gt;0\\;\\exists K\\subseteq X\\;(\\mathrm{Compact}_S(K,\\{U\\cap K:U\\in\\tau\\})\\land\\forall\\mu\\in\\mathcal M\\;(\\mu(X\\setminus K)&lt;\\varepsilon))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li>The measure11 tight-measure-family variant is an alias with reordered parameters.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-compact","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-compact]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-probability","status":"resolved","id":"5e0db065132180df","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-probability]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-compact","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Compact}_S$ (compactness predicate, see [[58-df-compact]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815